u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"padding: 8px; vertical-align: top; border-top-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-left-width: 1px; border-left-style: solid; border-left-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003eKick\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"padding: 8px; vertical-align: top; border-top-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-left-width: 1px; border-left-style: solid; border-left-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003ePlease do not abuse /report\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"padding: 8px; vertical-align: top; border-top-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-left-width: 1px; border-left-style: solid; border-left-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003eApril 4, 2016 at 6:12 PM\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSo.. first, I just reported one time. There was a user that just got banned like 30 minutes ago using an obvious Kill Aura, No KB, Fly, etc.\u003cbr\u003eEveryone was hackusating him and when I saw him I just laugh.. I though the mods where specting him so I just make a report saying : \" /report NICK lol lmaooo.\u003cbr\u003eI know that I shouldn`t make reports like that, I`m sorry, but mods where specting him and that kick was not even necesary.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThanks, Nova","body_tagged":"Hey I just got warned..\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\"Staff\" : Sho\u003cbr\u003eType : Warn\u003cbr\u003eReason :\u0026nbsp;\u003ctable class=\"table table-bordered table-striped table-no-sort no-margin\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px; width: 842px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 0px; border-top-style: solid; border-right-style: solid; border-bottom-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-right-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-bo