eft-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003ePlease do not abuse /report\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"padding: 8px; vertical-align: top; border-top-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-left-width: 1px; border-left-style: solid; border-left-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);\"\u003eApril 4, 2016 at 6:12 PM\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSo.. first, I just reported one time. There was a user that just got banned like 30 minutes ago using an obvious Kill Aura, No KB, Fly, etc.\u003cbr\u003eEveryone was hackusating him and when I saw him I just laugh.. I though the mods where specting him so I just make a report saying : \" /report NICK lol lmaooo.\u003cbr\u003eI know that I shouldn`t make reports like that, I`m sorry, but mods where specting him and that kick was not even necesary.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThanks, Nova","created_at":1459805069,"title":"Warn - NovaLikesPvP","replies":[{"id":292082,"author":"Spoookeh","body":"Hi Nova,\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI'll let Sho know about this appeal and hopefully he'll be able to reply soon.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e-Spoookeh","body_tagged":"Hi Nova,\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI'll let Sho know about this appeal and hopefully he'll be able to reply soon.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e-Spoookeh","created_at":1459812526},{"id":292211,"author":"Sho","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eHey Nova,\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\"\u0026gt;I know that I shouldn`t make reports like that\"\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIf you were well aware that you shouldn't make reports like that why did you do it in the first place? You know you were going to break a rule, so I just punished you accordingly. We don't want players using /report informally or for jokes because it's confusing and it can drown out any actual reports that are submitted. I'm just doing my job here, I enforce the rules not make them.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eAppeal Denied\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eHey Nova,\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\"\u0026gt;I know that I shouldn`t make reports like that\"\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIf you were well aware that you shouldn't make reports like that why did you do it in the first place? You know you were going to break a rule, so I just punished you accordingly. We don't want players using /report informally or for jokes because it's confusing and it can drown out any actual reports that are submitted. I'm just doing my job here, I enforce the rules not make them.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eAppeal Denied\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e","created_at":1459855773}]}